sharps nor flats. It's all white notes. So in the&nbsp;
second example, I play the final chord was this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:14.160
so in this chord there are the notes C, E and&nbsp;
G which in the C major world. is Chord one now.&nbsp;&nbsp;

