00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:32.220
bit and gave myself time to very&nbsp;
think very deeply and then execute&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:36.120
it successfully. So once you master that&nbsp;
you might upgrade to something like this.

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:53.220
So what you saw there was I took my time to&nbsp;
find the right positions get over there think&nbsp;&nbsp;

